---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDITIONAL NOTICE — Open Core Model
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is the FREE / open-source core of MeshForge 3D.
It is provided under the MIT License above, with the following tier policy:

  FREE (this repository):
    - Image-to-3D mesh generation (TripoSR engine, MIT)
    - Export GLB / OBJ / STL / PLY (pure geometry, no colors or textures)
    - Resolution up to 256 (medium quality)
    - Fully offline, no telemetry

  PRO / STUDIO (commercial, license key):
    - Vertex colors (fast colored preview)
    - UV atlas unwrapping + baked textures up to 8K
    - Resolution up to 384 (high quality)
    - Batch processing (folder of images -> folder of GLB)
    - Text-to-Image concept generation pipeline
    - Priority support, commercial usage rights for companies

Purchasing a Pro/Studio license supports continued open-source development.